---
layout: base.njk
title: Join Us
---

<section id="wrapper">
  <header>
    <div class="inner">
      <h2>Join Us</h2>
      <p>Come as a guest first. No registration, no commitment, just show up.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="inner">
      <h3 class="major">Step 1: Come as a guest</h3>
      <p>The easiest way to experience BH2 is to walk in to one of our regular meetings. Guests are always welcome with no need to register in advance and no pressure to speak. Just turn up, take a seat, and see what we are about.</p>
      <div class="box" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);padding:2rem;border-radius:4px;margin:2rem 0;">
        <h4 style="color:#F2DF74;margin-bottom:1rem;">When and where we meet</h4>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;">
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><strong>Schedule:</strong> {{ site.meetingSchedule }}</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><strong>Venue:</strong> {{ site.venue }}</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> {{ site.address }}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <h3 class="major">Step 2: Register on Eventbrite (optional)</h3>
      <p>We list our upcoming meetings on Eventbrite so you can plan ahead. Registration is free and helps us know how many guests to expect.</p>
      <ul class="actions">
        <li><a href="{{ site.eventbrite }}" target="_blank" class="button primary">View Upcoming Meetings on Eventbrite</a></li>
      </ul>
      <h3 class="major">Step 3: Become a member</h3>
      <p>If BH2 feels like the right fit, joining is straightforward. Annual membership is SGD 280, which covers Toastmasters International dues as well as your BH2 club membership.</p>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Fee</th><th>Amount</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Annual membership</td><td>SGD 280 per year</td><td>Includes Toastmasters International membership fees</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <h3 class="major">Get in touch</h3>
      <ul class="contact">
        <li class="icon solid fa-envelope"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
        <li class="icon brands fa-instagram"><a href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank">Instagram</a></li>
        <li class="icon brands fa-facebook-f"><a href="{{ site.facebook }}" target="_blank">Facebook</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
